---
// Footer Global Institucional para Clínica Horizonte
---

<footer class="bg-white dark:bg-[#071916] border-t border-sky-100 dark:border-teal-900/60 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-auto text-xs relative z-10 transition-colors duration-200">
  {/* Sección Principal de Contenido del Footer */}
  <div class="max-w-[1720px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      
      {/* Columna 1 y 2: Identidad y Misión */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xs">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 block">Clínica Horizonte</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-sky-600 font-mono block -mt-0.5 font-medium">Centro de Atención Ambulatoria</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Institución privada de salud ambulatoria de alta complejidad en Santiago de Chile. Atendemos a más de 180 pacientes diarios con un modelo de agendamiento coordinado sin solapamientos, registro clínico seguro y convenios directos Fonasa e Isapres.
        </p>

        {/* Sellos de Confianza y Estándares */}
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 text-sky-800 text-[11px] font-medium">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
            Prestador Acreditado SIS
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-medium">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
            Ficha Clínica Protegida
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 2: Plataforma & Módulos */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Plataforma</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Inicio Institucional</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Panel Operacional</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/agenda" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Agenda Médica & Horas</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/pacientes" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Directorio de Pacientes</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/atencion-clinica" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Atención y Ficha Médica</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/pagos" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Caja, Bonos & Convenios</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/auditoria" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Auditoría Sanitaria</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 3: Especialidades Clínicas */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Especialidades</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/agenda" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Medicina General</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">20 min</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/agenda" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Pediatría Integral</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">30 min</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/agenda" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Cardiología Preventiva</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">30 min</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/agenda" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Traumatología</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">20 min</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-slate-500 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Toma de Muestras & ECG</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Ambulatorio</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 4: Contacto & Ubicación */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">Contacto & Atención</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span>Av. Providencia 1420, Providencia, Santiago, Chile</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-mono text-slate-800 font-medium">+56 2 2840 9200</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <span class="font-mono text-slate-800 font-medium">contacto@clinicahorizonte.cl</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2 pt-1">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <span class="block text-slate-800 font-medium">Lun - Vie: 08:00 a 20:00 hrs</span>
              <span class="block text-slate-500">Sábados: 08:30 a 14:00 hrs</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Barra Intermedia de Integración Técnica y Estado de Infraestructura */}
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-teal-900/60 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-sky-50/60 dark:bg-teal-950/40 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-sky-100 dark:border-teal-900/50">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs">
        <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">Infraestructura del Sistema:</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
          Backend API v1.0.0 Activo
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-sky-100 dark:bg-teal-950/70 text-sky-800 dark:text-teal-300 border border-sky-200 dark:border-teal-800 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">
          PostgreSQL 17 Relacional
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs">
        <a
          id="swagger-doc-link-footer"
          href="/api/docs"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-blue-600 dark:text-teal-400 hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-teal-300 font-medium transition"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
          </svg>
          <span>Swagger UI / Contrato OpenAPI 3.x</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/login"
          class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 dark:bg-teal-900/60 text-sky-800 dark:text-teal-200 border border-sky-200 dark:border-teal-700 hover:bg-sky-200 dark:hover:bg-teal-800 transition text-[11px] font-medium"
        >
          Acceso Personal
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Barra Inferior de Derechos y Legales */}
  <div class="border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-teal-950 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#05110f] py-5 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
    <div class="max-w-[1720px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div>
        <span>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Clínica Horizonte S.A. Todos los derechos reservados.</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline mx-2 text-slate-300">|</span>
        <span class="block sm:inline mt-1 sm:mt-0 text-slate-500">Atención ambulatoria conforme a la Ley N° 20.584 de Derechos y Deberes del Paciente.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer">Términos de Servicio</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">•</span>
        <span class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer">Privacidad de Datos Clínicos</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">•</span>
        <span class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer">Reglamento Interno</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      const swaggerFooter = document.getElementById('swagger-doc-link-footer');
      if (swaggerFooter) {
        const base = window.__PUBLIC_API_URL__ || `${window.location.protocol}//${window.location.hostname}:3000`;
        swaggerFooter.href = base.replace(/\/api\/v1\/?$/, '').replace(/\/+$/, '') + '/api/docs';
      }
    })();
  </script>
</footer>
